steps.human:
Author a parameterized bounded query and its self-describing input/output contract, tests and reviewed evaluation cases. Preserve the question and source context for resumption.

Current bounded recipe compilation is an implementation baseline; the outstanding proper-query authoring architecture decision is not silently resolved here.

I/O boundary: The implemented baseline is a bounded recipe, not arbitrary generated Cypher. The exact QueryCandidate fields document that baseline; wider proper-query authoring remains a design gap.

Contract fields and examples (generated)
Consumes:
  query_build/question: string (required)
  query_build/source_sha: string (required)
  query_build/component_ids: array (required)
  query_build/expected_result: string (optional; default "Attributable canonical entities for the original evidence need")
  Schema: [query_build](kernel/schemas/leafcutter.query_build_request.v1.schema.json)
Produces:
  candidate_output/candidate: object (required)
  Schema: [candidate_output](kernel/schemas/leafcutter.query_candidate.v1.schema.json)
  query_candidate/descriptor/operation: string (required)
  query_candidate/descriptor/version: string (required)
  query_candidate/descriptor/parameters: object (required)
  query_candidate/descriptor/recipe: object (required)
  query_candidate/reviewer: string (required)
  query_candidate/cases: array (required)
  Runtime contract: [query_candidate](knowledge/query_models.py)

PROPOSED - missing JSON binding (produces): General authored-query contract
The target proper-query authoring architecture remains undecided; the existing bounded recipe does not establish a freeform query input/output contract.
